WEBVTT - Solar panels mission video (3D simulation), English descriptive captions

NOTE
No speech. Each cue gives the values on the on-screen panel at its start time; the panel status does not change within a cue. The Sun is computed; power and energy are a stated model for a flat (horizontal) panel per m², before any cell efficiency; array size and timing are illustrative. While the Sun is low the display exposure is raised (not to scale).

